  "rationale": "30 units of Curd 400G at Outlet 05 (East Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the expiry deadline on 2026-09-23; doing nothing writes off ₹6265 and a blanket 20% markdown costs ₹5418. This play uses a bundle with SKU-MULTIGRAIN-BREAD-400G at ₹300 for 315 consented customers (Dairy occasionals, Sweets occasionals, Everyday staples shoppers, Festival sweets loyalists, Personal care regulars, Tea connoisseurs): expected 30 units, margin ₹775, discount cost ₹1050, waste avoided ₹6265 (CI 2 to 88 units; prior n 20, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"2. Prefer bundles and transfers over blanket markdowns; markdowns are the last lever.\" This bundle play pairs Curd 400G with Multigrain Bread 400G for a bundle price of 300, which satisfies the dairy category margin floor of 8.00% and is preferred over blanket markdowns by Kutumb Mart policy. It reaches all 315 consented customers across candidate segments to clear the 30 units at risk before the expiry deadline.",
